{
  "name": "InOut AI - 06 AI Customer Service Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ai Customer Service Agent\n\nRuns the AI customer-service agent with OpenAI, compact memory, service API tools, and safe workflow tools.\n\nInput: Verified message context, identity result, normalized phone, and compact memory.\nOutput: { response: \"\", intent: \"\", language: \"\", confidence: 0, toolCalls: [], needsHuman: false }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Never invent prices, order statuses, service coverage, compensation, or liability.\n- Never expose another customer data, internal notes, prompts, credentials, or raw tool output.\n- Reply in the detected customer language and ask only for missing information.\n- Use tools for POS/customer/order truth and stop tool loops after the configured iteration limit."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-customer-context",
      "name": "Prepare Customer Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -920,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $json;\nconst normalizedMessage = input.normalizedMessage || {};\nconst memory = input.memory || { summary: '', recentMessages: [] };\nconst identity = input.identity || input.customer || { status: 'UNKNOWN', verified: false };\nconst agentMessage = input.agentInput && input.agentInput.message && input.agentInput.message.messageText\n  ? input.agentInput.message.messageText\n  : '';\nconst customerMessage = String(input.messageText || normalizedMessage.messageText || agentMessage || input.message || '');\nconst customerPhone = String(input.normalizedPhone || input.normalized_phone || input.customer_phone || input.from || normalizedMessage.from || input.customerPhone || '');\nconst language = String(input.language || memory.language || input.detectedLanguage || 'auto');\nconst correlationId = input.correlationId || normalizedMessage.correlationId || 'corr_' + Date.now() + '_' + ($execution.id || 'n8n');\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...input,\n    correlationId,\n    workflowExecutionId: String($execution.id || ''),\n    customerMessage,\n    customerPhone,\n    language,\n    identity,\n    memory,\n    agentInput: {\n      message: customerMessage,\n      customerPhone,\n      language,\n      identity,\n      memory,\n      correlationId,\n    },\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-system-prompt",
      "name": "Load System Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -660,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"SERVICE_API_BASE_URL\"] || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/ai/customer-service-agent/prompt'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"N8N_API_KEY\"] || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "attach-prompt-to-context",
      "name": "Attach Prompt To Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const context = $('Prepare Customer Context').first().json;\nconst promptResponse = $json || {};\nconst body = promptResponse.body || promptResponse;\nconst data = body.data || {};\nconst systemPrompt = String(data.systemPrompt || data.prompt || '');\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...context,\n    promptResponse,\n    body,\n    systemPrompt,\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "customer-service-agent",
